culinary gangster with a plate of food and a heart full of hospitality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck under tables, crouch behind furniture, and use the chaos of the festival to slip through undetected\u2026 <i>just don\u2019t let them see you</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896760/extras/e71fb8569438ebf9b574fe1028de4a78.poster.avif?t=1772631609\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896760/extras/e71fb8569438ebf9b574fe1028de4a78.webm?t=1772631609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896760/extras/e71fb8569438ebf9b574fe1028de4a78.mp4?t=1772631609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every escape in this stealth comedy game has its obstacles, but in this festival village, they rarely look like trouble\u2026 at first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The host whose master plan could rival a king\u2019s treasury. The street performer whose dazzling act turns your quiet getaway into tonight\u2019s headline. The relative whose endless demands make slipping away feel like an Olympic sport. And somewhere beyond the music and laughter, <i>the faint stir of something older, stranger, lurking just out of sight</i> ready to turn your family escape into a whole new kind of chase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Outsmarting the festival means outsmarting personalities bigger than the celebration itself.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR ARSENAL OF AVOIDANCE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Table Cover</strong> \u2013 Slip under tables and low furniture to avoid being spotted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crouch &amp; Dodge</strong> \u2013 Stay low, sidestep, and weave your way around the busiest rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pattern Reading</strong> \u2013 Learn each relative\u2019s route and habits to slip through unnoticed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896760/extras/61f4c7c1339eb22e4192369b3dd9b909.poster.avif?t=1772631609\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896760/extras/61f4c7c1339eb22e4192369b3dd9b909.webm?t=1772631609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896760/extras/61f4c7c1339eb22e4192369b3dd9b909.mp4?t=1772631609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Resort: Tea Cup Takedown </strong>\u2013<strong> </strong>Spot pursuer, aim, throw. Nothing stops a determined chaser faster than a flying cup of steamingly empty <i>teacup</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WORLD OF AZOOMA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore bustling courtyards and lively, chatter-filled living rooms</strong> in a vibrant village, rich with cultural celebration and everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But <strong>stay alert.</strong> Uncle Shaddad\u2019s Culinary Gangsters have placed the village under lockdown, transforming alleys, courtyards, and rooms into watchful traps. One wrong step and you\u2019ll be swept into the chaotic festival, where every laugh, drumbeat, and whisper brings a fresh stealth challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896760/extras/827089c520bfe9f758c14cf58089a032.poster.avif?t=1772631609\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896760/extras/827089c520bfe9f758c14cf58089a032.webm?t=1772631609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896760/extras/827089c520bfe9f758c14cf58089a032.mp4?t=1772631609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Azooma Escape</strong>, the world is more than just a setting, you have to outsmart every corner of this lively festival village before it swallows you whole.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced stealth gameplay with a cultural twist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive environments full of hiding opportunities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relatives that are both hilarious and terrifying in equal measure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lighthearted story of <strong>festival-scale family chaos</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Arabic, \u201c<i>Azooma</i>\u201d means <i>gathering or invitation</i> and here, it\u2019s both your mission and your greatest threat.<br>Will you slip through the crowd and escape the ultimate social ambush\u2026 or get pulled into another round of tea and small talk?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Perfect for stealth fans, cultural comedy lovers, and anyone who\u2019s ever hidden just to avoid a chatty relative.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896760/extras/bdc398c51a2d8bae983897b07d588c47.poster.avif?t=1772631609\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896760/extras/bdc398c51a2d8bae983897b07d588c47.webm?t=1772631609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Ash Games Studio"],"genres":[{"descrip